<section id="hero" class="hero">
<div class="hero-bg"></div>
<div class="hero-pattern"></div>
<div class="hero-content">
<div class="hero-badge">
<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
10+ National Awards
</div>
<h1>Authentic.<br>Artisan.<br>Delicious.</h1>
<p class="hero-sub">Manchester's finest artisan bakery and continental deli — handcrafting traditional European baked goods and exceptional deli fare since 1964. Sixty-two years of dedication to craft, quality, and community.</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a href="#story" class="btn btn-gold">Discover Our Story</a>
<a href="#locations" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);color:#fff;">Find Us</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-awards">
<div class="award-badge"><strong>62</strong>Years</div>
<div class="award-badge"><strong>10+</strong>Awards</div>
</div>
<div class="hero-scroll">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
Scroll
</div>
</section><div class="intro-strip">
<div class="container">
<div class="intro-stat"><strong>1964</strong><span>Est. Manchester</span></div>
<div class="intro-stat"><strong>62</strong><span>Years of Craft</span></div>
<div class="intro-stat"><strong>50+</strong><span>Staff Members</span></div>
<div class="intro-stat"><strong>10+</strong><span>National Awards</span></div>
<div class="intro-stat"><strong>2</strong><span>Manchester Locations</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="awards-bar"><div class="awards-track"><span class="award-item"><strong>10+</strong> National Awards</span><span class="award-item"><strong>1964</strong> Founded</span><span class="award-item"><strong>62</strong> Years Craft</span><span class="award-item"><strong>50+</strong> Breads &amp; Pastries</span><span class="award-item"><strong>Award Winner</strong> German Norlander</span><span class="award-item"><strong>48h</strong> Sourdough</span><span class="award-item"><strong>10+</strong> National Awards</span><span class="award-item"><strong>1964</strong> Founded</span><span class="award-item"><strong>62</strong> Years Craft</span><span class="award-item"><strong>50+</strong> Breads &amp; Pastries</span><span class="award-item"><strong>Award Winner</strong> German Norlander</span><span class="award-item"><strong>48h</strong> Sourdough</span></div></div>
<section id="story" class="section">
<div class="container">
<div class="story-grid">
<div class="story-image">
<div class="story-image-placeholder" style="background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556909114-f6e7ad7d3136?w=900&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;position:relative">
<div class="story-year-badge">Est. 1964</div>
</div>
<div class="story-text">
<p class="section-label">Our Story</p>
<h2 class="section-title">A Manchester Institution Since 1964</h2>
<div class="divider"></div>
<p>Barbakan was founded on a simple belief: that exceptional bread and deli food should be made by hand, using traditional methods and the finest ingredients. For over six decades, we have been a cornerstone of Chorlton-cum-Hardy life, serving generation after generation of families who trust us for their daily bread.</p>
<p class="quote">"We don't take shortcuts. Every loaf is hand-crafted, every sausage sourced with care. That's what sets us apart and always has."<cite>Frankie Dyer, Director</cite></p>
<p>Today, under the stewardship of Director Frankie Dyer, Barbakan employs around 50 people across our Chorlton and Wilmslow locations. We wholesale to the University of Manchester and local businesses, while remaining true to the neighbourhood bakery ethos that has defined us since the beginning.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section id="bakery" class="section section--white">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-3">
<p class="section-label" style="justify-content:center">The Bakery</p>
<h2 class="section-title">Handcrafted Daily, Baked With Purpose</h2>
<p class="section-subtitle" style="margin:0 auto">From our award-winning German Norlander loaf to our 48-hour fermented sourdough, every item that leaves our ovens carries 62 years of knowledge, passion, and uncompromising quality.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
<div class="product-card">
<div class="product-card-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549931319-a545dcf3bc73?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="German Norlander loaf — award-winning German-style artisan bread with a golden crust" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="product-card-body">
<p class="product-card-label">Award Winner</p>
<h3 class="product-card-title">German Norlander</h3>
<p class="product-card-desc">Our signature German-style loaf, recognised nationally for its exceptional crust, open crumb, and authentic flavour. A true testament to traditional European baking.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="product-card">
<div class="product-card-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509440159596-0249088772ff?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="48-Hour Sourdough loaf with open, airy crumb and scored crust" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="product-card-body">
<p class="product-card-label">Signature</p>
<h3 class="product-card-title">48-Hour Sourdough</h3>
<p class="product-card-desc">Slow-fermented for two full days to develop an extraordinarily complex flavour and a beautifully open, airy crumb. Made with simple, natural ingredients.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="product-card">
<div class="product-card-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574071318508-1cdbab80d002?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Freshly baked ciabatta and focaccia loaves from Barbakan's oven" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="product-card-body">
<p class="product-card-label">Bakery Favourite</p>
<h3 class="product-card-title">Ciabatta &amp; Focaccia</h3>
<p class="product-card-desc">Italian classics, made with olive oil and long fermentation. Light, airy interior with a crisp, golden crust. Perfect for sandwiches or alongside any meal.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="product-card">
<div class="product-card-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1585521720278-1b37662f7666?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Freshly boiled and baked Barbakan bagels with sesame and poppy seeds" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="product-card-body">
<p class="product-card-label">Popular Choice</p>
<h3 class="product-card-title">Bagels</h3>
<p class="product-card-desc">Boiled then baked for that distinctive chewy texture. Available plain, sesame, poppy seed, and everything seasoning. Supplied to First Street Bagels.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="product-card">
<div class="product-card-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623334044303-241021148842?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Laminated croissants and Danish pastries freshly baked at Barbakan" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="product-card-body">
<p class="product-card-label">Pastry Selection</p>
<h3 class="product-card-title">Danish &amp; Croissants</h3>
<p class="product-card-desc">Laminated doughs, hand-finished daily. Our pain au chocolat, almond croissants, and seasonal Danish pastries are among the most sought-after in south Manchester.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="product-card">
<div class="product-card-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1594989545472-c03ca30b6f06?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" alt="Authentic Bavarian-style pretzels with dark crust and coarse salt from Barbakan" loading="lazy"></div>
<div class="product-card-body">
<p class="product-card-label">Viennese Speciality</p>
<h3 class="product-card-title">Pretzels &amp; Rye</h3>
<p class="product-card-desc">Authentic Bavarian-style soft pretzels with a characteristic dark crust and salted finish. Alongside our rye breads, these reflect our German continental roots.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section id="deli" class="section section--alt">
<div class="container">
<div class="grid-2">
<div>
<p class="section-label">The Deli</p>
<h2 class="section-title">Continental European<br>Delicatessen</h2>
<div class="divider"></div>
<p class="section-subtitle">Step beyond the bread counter and discover our carefully curated deli. From aged Continental cheeses to hand-carved charcuterie, olives, and house-made preserves, we bring the finest of European food culture to Manchester.</p>
<div style="margin-top:2rem">
<div class="feature-list">
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-icon">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
</div>
<div class="feature-text">
<h4>Imported &amp; House-Cured Charcuterie</h4>
<p>Prosciutto di Parma, chorizo, saucisson, and house-made specials.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-icon">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9"/></svg>
</div>
<div class="feature-text">
<h4>Continental Cheeses</h4>
<p>A curated selection sourced from specialist suppliers — aged cheddar, gorgonzola, Manchego, camembert, and seasonal specials.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-icon">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg>
</div>
<div class="feature-text">
<h4>Olives, Oils &amp; Preserves</h4>
<p>Kalamata olives,extra virgin olive oils, artisan balsamic, and fruit preserves.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="feature-item">
<div class="feature-icon">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
</div>
<div class="feature-text">
<h4>Made-to-Order Platters</h4>
<p>Custom charcuterie and cheese boards for gatherings, celebrations, and corporate events.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="deli-highlight">
<div class="deli-pillar">
<p class="deli-pillar-label">Catering</p>
<h3>Events &amp; Functions</h3>
<p>Bespoke deli platters, sandwich selections, and continental breakfasts for corporate events, weddings, and private celebrations.</p>
</div>
<div class="deli-pillar">
<p class="deli-pillar-label">Wholesale</p>
<h3>Trade Partners</h3>
<p>We supply the University of Manchester and Bents Garden Centre, among others. Contact us to discuss wholesale arrangements.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section id="pan" class="pan-hero">
<div class="container">
<div class="pan-grid">
<div class="pan-text">
<p class="pan-badge">
<svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
Weekend Favourite
</p>
<h2>The Saturday German Sausage Pan</h2>
<p>On Saturdays, our outdoor German sausage pan is a Chorlton institution. From 9am until sold out, we fire up the traditional pan and serve freshly grilled German sausages, sauerkraut, and mulled wine in a convivial outdoor setting. It's become one of Manchester's most beloved weekend traditions.</p>
<p>Bring the family, grab a bench, and enjoy some of the finest German sausages outside of Berlin — right here in Chorlton.</p>
<div>
<a href="#locations" class="btn btn-gold">Get Directions</a>
<a href="https://barbakan-deli.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-white" style="border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3)">Learn More</a>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<div class="product-card-image" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529041096609-9d5268822e26?w=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80') center/cover no-repeat"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section id="menu" class="section" style="background:var(--cream-dark)">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-3">
<p class="section-label" style="justify-content:center">Our Menu</p>
<h2 class="section-title">Freshly Made Every Day</h2>
<p class="section-subtitle" style="margin:0 auto">Morning pastries, ciabatta sizzlers, and artisan drinks from both our Chorlton and Wilmslow locations.</p>
</div>
<div class="menu-tabs" style="justify-content:center">
<button class="menu-tab active" data-tab="tab-breakfast">Breakfast</button>
<button class="menu-tab" data-tab="tab-lunch">Ciabatta Sizzlers</button>
<button class="menu-tab" data-tab="tab-cakes">Cakes &amp; Pastries</button>
<button class="menu-tab" data-tab="tab-drinks">Drinks</button>
</div>
<div id="tab-breakfast" class="menu-tab-content active">
<div class="menu-grid">
