</section><section id="catering" class="section section--white">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-3">
<p class="section-label" style="justify-content:center">Catering &amp; Hampers</p>
<h2 class="section-title">Bespoke Catering &amp; Gift Hampers</h2>
<p class="section-subtitle" style="margin:0 auto">Whether you're planning a corporate event, private celebration, or looking for the perfect gift, Barbakan creates bespoke catering selections and artisan food hampers tailored to your needs.</p>
</div>
<div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:2.5rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem">
<div class="deli-pillar">
<p class="deli-pillar-label">Events</p>
<h3>Corporate &amp; Private Catering</h3>
<p>Bespoke deli platters, continental breakfast selections, sandwich boards, and afternoon tea arrangements for business meetings, conferences, weddings, and celebrations. Our team will work with you to create a menu that delights your guests.</p>
</div>
<div class="deli-pillar">
<p class="deli-pillar-label">Gifts</p>
<h3>Artisan Food Hampers</h3>
<p>Beautifully packaged hampers featuring our award-winning breads, continental cheeses, charcuterie, preserves, and seasonal specials. Perfect for corporate gifts, housewarmings, or simply treating someone special.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="catering-form">
<form>
<p style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1.5rem;color:var(--dark)">Enquiry Form</p>
<div class="form-row">
<div class="form-group">
<label class="form-label" for="name">Your Name *</label>
<input class="form-input" type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Jane Smith" required>
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label class="form-label" for="email">Email Address *</label>
<input class="form-input" type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="jane@example.com" required>
</div>
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label class="form-label" for="type">Enquiry Type</label>
<select class="form-select" id="type" name="type">
<option value="">Please select...</option>
<option>Catering - Corporate Event</option>
<option>Catering - Private Event</option>
<option>Artisan Food Hamper</option>
<option>Wholesale Enquiry</option>
<option>Other</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label class="form-label" for="date">Event Date (if applicable)</label>
<input class="form-input" type="date" id="date" name="date">
</div>
<div class="form-group">
<label class="form-label" for="message">Tell Us About Your Requirements</label>
<textarea class="form-textarea" id="message" name="message" placeholder="Number of guests, dietary requirements, preferred delivery location, etc."></textarea>
</div>
<button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%">Send Enquiry</button>
</form>
<div class="form-success">
<svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="2" style="margin:0 auto 1rem"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
<h3>Thank You!</h3>
<p style="color:var(--text-muted)">We've received your enquiry and will be in touch shortly.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section id="locations" class="section section--alt">
<div class="container">
<div class="text-center mb-3">
<p class="section-label" style="justify-content:center">Visit Us</p>
